OL,3,GNEWSAMagistrates court set to reopen
OL,4,Aafter repair delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA magistrates court that closed at the
OL,7,Fbeginning of the year will reopen this
OL,8,Fweek after delayed refurbishment works
OL,9,Fwere completed.
OL,11,FOxford Magistrates' Court closed in
OL,12,FJanuary for "vital improvement works",
OL,13,Fincluding a roof replacement, and was
OL,14,Finitially set to be closed for about
OL,15,Fsix months.
OL,17,FBut in August, HM Courts and Tribunals
OL,18,FService (HMCTS) said the site would not
OL,19,Fbe ready to reopen until November -
OL,20,Fwith cases continuing to be heard at
OL,21,Fother local courts, including at
OL,22,FReading Magistrates' Court.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
