OL,3,GNEWSAMagistrates court set to reopen
OL,4,Aafter repair delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FHMCTS has now confirmed that Oxford
OL,7,FMagistrates' will reopen on Monday,
OL,8,Fwith listings for hearings taking place
OL,9,Fthat day posted online on Friday.
